description.en:
🌿 Elegant Tree of Life Metal Wall Decor 🌿

Transform your living space with this timeless Tree of Life metal wall art. Symbolizing growth, strength, connection, and harmony with nature, this intricate circular artwork creates a stunning focal point in any room—from living rooms and bedrooms to entryways and offices.

Crafted with high-precision laser cutting technology and finished with a premium quality powder coating, this piece combines durability with sleek modern elegance.

---

✨ KEY FEATURES:
• Material: High-grade durable metal
• Finish: Premium electrostatic powder coating (rust-resistant & long-lasting)
• Suitable for indoor and outdoor covered spaces
• Ready to hang: Easily mountable using the hidden hanging bracket on the back with just a single nail or screw.
• Sleek, modern flat profile designed to sit flush against your wall.

---

📐 AVAILABLE SIZES (Diameter):

We offer a wide range of sizes to fit any space perfect—from small accents to massive statement pieces:

• 30 cm | 11.8&quot;
• 40 cm | 15.7&quot;
• 50 cm | 19.7&quot;
• 60 cm | 23.6&quot;
• 70 cm | 27.6&quot;
• 80 cm | 31.5&quot;
• 90 cm | 35.4&quot;
• 100 cm | 39.4&quot;
• 110 cm | 43.3&quot;
• 120 cm | 47.2&quot;
• 130 cm | 51.2&quot;
• 140 cm | 55.1&quot;
• 150 cm | 59.1&quot;

*(Please measure your wall space prior to ordering to select the ideal size for your room).*

---

🎁 PERFECT GIFT IDEA:
An exceptional and meaningful gift for housewarmings, weddings, anniversaries, birthdays, Mother&#39;s Day, or Christmas. A piece of modern wall art that your loved ones will cherish for years.

---

📦 PACKAGING & SHIPPING:
• Carefully packaged in custom sturdy boxes to ensure safe arrival.
• Fast processing and tracked worldwide shipping.

📩 CUSTOM ORDERS & QUESTIONS:
If you have any questions or need a custom size or finish, feel free to send us a message! We&#39;re always happy to help.

